### 1. GET Semua Produk
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products

### 2. POST Tambah Produk 1 (Kopi Gayo, Stok: 50, Harga: 85000)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Kopi Gayo Arabika",
  "description": "Biji kopi sangrai premium 250g",
  "price": 85000.0,
  "stock": 50,
  "category": "Minuman"
}

### 3. POST Tambah Produk 2 (Sepatu Nike, Stok: 15, Harga: 850000)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sepatu Lari Nike Pegasus",
  "description": "Ukuran 42 warna hitam sporty",
  "price": 850000.0,
  "stock": 15,
  "category": "Sepatu"
}

### ========================================================
### FITUR TRANSAKSI MARKETPLACE (ORDERS / CHECKOUT)
### ========================================================

### 4. CHECKOUT BERHASIL: Beli 2 Kopi Gayo (ID: 1, Qty: 2)
# Ekspektasi: Total 170.000, Stok Kopi berkurang dari 50 -> 48
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### 5. CHECKOUT GAGAL: Beli melebihi stok (ID: 1, Qty: 999)
# Ekspektasi: 400 Bad Request ("Stok tidak mencukupi!")
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 999
}

### 6. CHECKOUT GAGAL: Barang tidak ada (ID: 999)
# Ekspektasi: 404 Not Found
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 999,
  "quantity": 1
}

### 7. GET Semua Riwayat Pesanan
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders

### 8. Cek Sisa Stok Kopi setelah checkout (Harusnya tinggal 48)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
